OL,3,GNEWSACentenarian gets 600 birthday
OL,4,Acards after appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centenarian has received more than
OL,7,F600 birthday cards from around the
OL,8,Fworld, after his care home appealed for
OL,9,Fjust 100 to mark his milestone
OL,10,Fbirthday.
OL,12,FReynolds Bowen, known as Ren, was born
OL,13,Fand raised in Fordham in east
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, and is the oldest
OL,15,Fresident and first person to reach 100
OL,16,Fat Waterhouse Manor care home in the
OL,17,Fvillage.
OL,19,FThe home put out an appeal for cards at
OL,20,Fthe start of November for Ren, who has
OL,21,Fonly two surviving relatives, and it
OL,22,Fwas overwhelmed by the response.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
